    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "p0",
        "title": "Recoil Counter",
        "text": "Got RG'd? If the defender swings back while you're still stuck in the same animation, you can Recoil Counter - cutting that animation short with an RG of your own. Cancelling into a new move usually throws that option away, so pick one: keep the pressure going, or wait and counter."
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "title": "Do Not Autopilot Afterward",
        "text": "A Recoil Counter gets you out of the immediate answer; it does not guarantee that your next attack wins. What you can do afterward depends on the move, spacing, and character. This lesson grades the universal part: recognizing the answer and timing the counter."
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
